Package: plank-tablet-relay-ble
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-dbus, python3-gi, bluez, systemd
Description: Bluetooth tablet relay for PLANK
 Receives Wacom tablet input through Linux input devices and provides
 physically approved pairing, diagnostic readings and an authenticated
 raw-HID workstation stream over Bluetooth LE. Includes a managed system
 service and persistent headset trust.
